      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A feature that keeps track of avatar audio and auto mutes it if the avatar is a certain radius away or the audio goes on longer than ~5 seconds would also be nice. I like leaving avatar audio on but I don't wanna hear the full soundtrack of your million poly JoJo's Bizarre Adventure avatar.\n\nWhile we're at it, avatars should NEVER be able to hijack a player's view unless the avatar doing that to you is the one you're wearing (e.g. an avatar with a HUD). I think we can all agree on that and the only avatars I've seen use that are obnoxious memes that zoom your screen in on the meme avatar and whatnot, which is very very very disorientating in VR but happens in public lobbies to new and experienced users alike all the time.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
